{"parse": {"title": "SU-04", "pageid": 134646, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/SU-03\" title=\"SU-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">SU-04</span><a href=\"/wiki/SU-05\" title=\"SU-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">SU</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">04</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E4.B8.80.E5.8F.B6.E7.9F.A5.E7.A7.8B\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"一叶知秋\">一叶知秋</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 一叶知秋</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Summer's Lease</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>想<span class=\"color-value\"></span>必<span class=\"color-value\"></span>每<span class=\"color-value\"></span>个<span class=\"color-value\"></span>人<span class=\"color-value\"></span>都<span class=\"color-value\"></span>已<span class=\"color-value\"></span>经<span class=\"color-value\"></span>看<span class=\"color-value\"></span>见<span class=\"color-value\"></span>了<span class=\"color-value\"></span>瓶<span class=\"color-value\"></span>壁<span class=\"color-value\"></span>上<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>第<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>片<span class=\"color-value\"></span>冰<span class=\"color-value\"></span>花<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 3410104</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_5_bg_lvguan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_5_bg_lvguan\"><img alt=\"2_5_bg_lvguan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/Cg-2_5_bg_lvguan.png/600px-Cg-2_5_bg_lvguan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/Cg-2_5_bg_lvguan.png/900px-Cg-2_5_bg_lvguan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/Cg-2_5_bg_lvguan.png/1200px-Cg-2_5_bg_lvguan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>编辑已经在床边默坐了许久。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>每个角落都没有熟悉的蜘蛛朋友，她的胸针也始终不曾亮起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她已经拿着胸针走遍了城内的大街小巷，但留给她的只有死一样的寂静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芦草结：</div><div>不行，联系不上编辑部……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>几片枯黄的叶子自她的头上掉下，落在床褥之间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芦草结：</div><div>也许我应该先出县城，坐大巴去市区，询问空心木女士的意见后再折返回来……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芦草结：</div><div>不……那个人太可疑了，空心木女士绝不会让我再继续调查了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芦草结：</div><div>所以我应该就此放弃，回到总部。如果我还有时间，就再筹备新的选题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>你还有多少时间？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芦草结：</div><div>我……还有时间吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>编辑自嘲地笑了笑。她捡起掉落在被间的草叶，将它轻轻展平。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313813.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-313813.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313813.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313813.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-313813.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313813.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-313813.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313813.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芦草结：</div><div>冬天就要到了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313813.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-313813.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313813.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313813.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-313813.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313813.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-313813.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313813.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芦草结：</div><div>到那时，我便该枯萎了。尽管明年又会有一株新的苇草，但那株草并不是我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313813.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-313813.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313813.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313813.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-313813.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313813.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-313813.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313813.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芦草结：</div><div>对于我们这样春生冬死的草本植物而言，这就是我们的命运。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313813.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-313813.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313813.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313813.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-313813.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313813.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-313813.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313813.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芦草结：</div><div>惠姑……她后来怎样了呢？她逃过这样的命运了么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芦草结：</div><div>……不行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芦草结：</div><div>我……不甘心。我不甘心就这样结束，这明明是我离答案最近的一次……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>草叶被认真地夹在了笔记本的纸页之间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芦草结：</div><div>风的凝滞本就是异常事件。解开它，风就能恢复正常的流动。没有我，它也理应被其他神秘学家解开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芦草结：</div><div>不必去理会枯荣自任。我能靠自己的本事解开第一个系结，也能解开剩下的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芦草结：</div><div>我……必须完成我的选题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她合上笔记本，踏出了房门。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>意识再一次被狂风从躯体中抽出，这依旧让芦草结感到极大的不适。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>强忍住这种感觉，她等待着预料中的下坠。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-313801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-313801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-313801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芦草结：</div><div>……还会是惠姑吗？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_4_bg_06.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_4_bg_06\"><img alt=\"3_4_bg_06\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/Cg-3_4_bg_06.png/600px-Cg-3_4_bg_06.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/Cg-3_4_bg_06.png/900px-Cg-3_4_bg_06.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/Cg-3_4_bg_06.png/1200px-Cg-3_4_bg_06.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>物伤其类的悲伤短暂升起，旋即被隐约耳熟的声音打断。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"642714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-642714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-642714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"642714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-642714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-642714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-642714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-642714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>小程巡检？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"642714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-642714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-642714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"642714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-642714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-642714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-642714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-642714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>我能进来吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313719.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-313719.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313719.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313719.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-313719.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313719.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-313719.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313719.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>请。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_bg_guanfushinei2\"><img alt=\"1_6_bg_guanfushinei2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2.png/600px-Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2.png/900px-Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_4_bg_06.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_4_bg_06\"><img alt=\"3_4_bg_06\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/Cg-3_4_bg_06.png/600px-Cg-3_4_bg_06.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/Cg-3_4_bg_06.png/900px-Cg-3_4_bg_06.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/Cg-3_4_bg_06.png/1200px-Cg-3_4_bg_06.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>处理完城门处的骚乱后，杜六叩响了城门门军房的门。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>书案前，程和光正埋头研究着厚厚的案卷。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜六：</div><div>小程巡检，那道人已经解除了咒法，百姓中有几名因黄狗精而受了惊吓，磕碰了几处，我已命人送去医治了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜六：</div><div>城门关卡也已恢复秩序，平民正有序过关。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜六：</div><div>杨武将那道人和她的骡子押进了城门班房，等候您查问。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>程和光点点头，将目光从案卷中拔了出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>好，你回岗吧，我马上就去杨武那边。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_bg_guanfushinei2\"><img alt=\"1_6_bg_guanfushinei2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2.png/600px-Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2.png/900px-Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>杜六好奇地上前瞅了瞅程和光的手中之物，冲着密密麻麻的字抱怨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜六：</div><div>小程巡检，属下不懂，今年庙会的搜检真要这么严苛吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>“高跷巡神”岂是普通的庙会？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜六：</div><div>即使它再重要，为了调查动物遗尸的案件，也有些过为已甚了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜六：</div><div>更何况现在并无任何证据表明此事为精怪所为，兴许就是山上饿极的野兽干的呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜六：</div><div>而且即使就是“它们”作祟，我们也无需做出如此大的阵仗……毕竟，谁知这其中是否涉及“它们”自己的恩怨情仇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>什么叫“它们”？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>无论是人是妖，只要有违反大明律令、威胁百姓安全之事，我们就当义不容辞。何必想这么多无关紧要之事？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>你也知道，最近县里不太太平。我总觉得，这动物遗尸的案件与其他精怪犯下的案子有千丝万缕的联系。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>程和光指了指手中的案卷。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-313701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-313701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-313701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>这是刚送来的案子，今早在城中春花巷内又发现了一具动物遗尸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-313701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-313701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-313701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>与前几案相同，被发现时尸体面容灰白，肌肉失养，但肢体完整。在案发地的不远处，也再次出现了神秘游行队伍的目击报告。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-313701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-313701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-313701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>散播长生流言的正是这支游行队伍，据我所知，已经有县民被他们蛊惑，去修行什么“长生之法”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-313701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-313701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-313701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>正值“高跷巡神”开办期间，厉守备早就嘱咐过我们，在此期间定要护县民周全，我们有什么理由不严查？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"642712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-642712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-642712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"642712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-642712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-642712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-642712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-642712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜六：</div><div>可是这几天兄弟们跑前跑后，轮流站岗，早就累得要命——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>杜六还未讲完，门军房的门便再度被叩响。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"643902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-643902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-643902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"643902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-643902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-643902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-643902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-643902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">巡捕Ⅰ：</div><div>程巡检，杨武问您何时过去！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>我知道，我马上就去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>抱怨尚未开始就被打断，杜六只得把满腔苦水都咽进肚里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜六：</div><div>那属下就先行……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>等一下！咳……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>杜六站在原地，等待着程和光发话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>我……我知道最近因为城防的事情三班倒，大家都很疲乏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>程和光不熟练地搜肠刮肚着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>此事过后，我定会在县里最好的酒楼中……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>宴请各位。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜六：</div><div>那属下代弟兄们谢过小程巡检了。不过小程巡检自己的俸禄应该就没多少，到时候……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜六：</div><div>我让弟兄们先喝三大碗井水再去，免得小程巡检难堪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>不必，此时鲈鱼正肥美，我与那酒楼的后厨相熟，自带食材的话，花销并不会太高。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜六：</div><div>如果是小程巡检自己钓的，那我便通知弟兄们空着肚子等了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜六：</div><div>“涣州鲈鱼王”的名号，今年还没易主吗？当年那条28斤的鲈鱼可真叫人眼馋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>不过是钓着玩玩，顺带补贴家用……好了，执勤期间，不宜聊太多无关话题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"642710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bd/HeadIconSmall-642710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-642710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"642710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bd/HeadIconSmall-642710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-642710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bd/HeadIconSmall-642710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-642710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜六：</div><div>得嘞！那属下告退。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>杜六退了出去，程和光便又将精力投回到了案卷之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>目所能及处，一切景象又烟雾般消散。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>芦草结已经习惯了这片黑暗。她等待着眼前重新亮起旅馆那扇推开的窗户。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-313801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-313801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-313801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芦草结：</div><div>并不是惠姑……这风结里有多少人的往事？<br />他们都是当年的当事人？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314117.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-314117.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314117.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314117.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-314117.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314117.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-314117.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314117.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>别急，我帮你一把。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313812.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-313812.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313812.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313812.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-313812.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313812.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-313812.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313812.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芦草结：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>风从她的身边呼啸而过，被牵引着汇往未知的远处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的思绪先下沉，蔓延出无数根系，扎根于泥土。随后，又被一首童谣托起。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "SU-04"}}